$"{Value{Number: 1}"
$"{Format("unterminated)}
$"{value /* unterminated }"
$"{value // }"
$"single } brace"
$"{Format($"inner {value}")"

/* Expected error: one lexer diagnostic per malformed interpolated string line, with recovery on the next line.
 * Reason: rules/foundations/lexical_structure.md §14.3 requires balanced interpolation expressions, doubled literal braces, and termination before the physical line ending.
